  <!-- ══════════════════ TEA 3 — THE PLEASURE BREW ══════════════════
       PURE XML, as the spec requires: chemical joy from the ingestible
       block, and the strong short thought via specialThoughtDirect (the
       vanilla field for "eating this gives this memory" — there is no
       vanilla IngestionOutcomeDoer that gives a thought, verified this
       pass: the six shipped doers are GiveHediff, OffsetNeed,
       OffsetPsyfocus, OffsetHemogen, Psilocap and UseThing).
       No CompProperties_Drug and no chemical: it cannot be stockpiled,
       cannot be put in a drug policy, and dies in two days, so it can never
       become a habit in the mechanical sense. Nothing to be addicted to.
       ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <ThingDef ParentName="DrugBase">
    <defName>RUT_Tea_Pleasure</defName>
    <label>lussa crown brew</label>
    <description>The crown's cap wrung out over heat into half a cup of something that smells like a remembered summer. It is the most straightforwardly wonderful thing on this planet and it is gone by the day after tomorrow.</description>
