       consumer is the Slime kit — ship the items, let the Slime kit wire
       the effects." So this is an INERT PAYLOAD: no outcomeDoers, no
       ingestible block at all, no hediff. It is a thing you can brew, carry
       for two days and hand to a mechanism that does not exist yet.
       Deliberately NOT given a guessed toxic effect: that would be building
       the Slime's half of a mechanic nobody has ruled on.
       It is still a live prep (both comps, both clocks) and still a Rot
       treasure for card 6.
       ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
